# 🧠 Q1. Teacher: `Object.defineProperty()` kya karta hai?

👉 **Student:**
Ye ek method hai jo object ki **property banata hai ya uske rules control karta hai**.

```text
Property + uske rules define karta hai
```

---

# 🔥 Simple Example

```js
const obj = {};

Object.defineProperty(obj, "name", {
  value: "Vishnu"
});

console.log(obj.name);
```

👉 Output:

```
Vishnu
```

👉 Yaha:

* `"name"` → property
* `"Vishnu"` → value

---

# 🧠 Q2. Teacher: Isme special kya hai?

👉 **Student:**
Normal object me:

```js
obj.name = "Vishnu";
```

👉 BUT `defineProperty()` me:
👉 hum **rules bhi control kar sakte hain**

---

# 🔥 Q3. Teacher: Example (writable = false)

```js
const obj = {};

Object.defineProperty(obj, "name", {
  value: "Vishnu",
  writable: false
});

obj.name = "Rahul"; // ❌ change nahi hoga

console.log(obj.name);
```

---

### 🎯 Output:

```
Vishnu
```

👉 Kyun?

```text
writable: false → value change allowed nahi
```

---

# 🧠 Q4. Teacher: Writable kya hota hai?

👉 **Student:**

| writable | Meaning                   |
| -------- | ------------------------- |
| true     | value change ho sakti hai |
| false    | value change nahi hogi    |

---

# 🔥 Q5. Teacher: enumerable kya hota hai?

👉 **Student:**
👉 Property loop me dikhegi ya nahi

---

## Example

```js
const obj = {};

Object.defineProperty(obj, "name", {
  value: "Vishnu",
  enumerable: false
});

console.log(Object.keys(obj));
```

👉 Output:

```
[]
```

👉 Kyun?

```text
enumerable: false → hidden property
```

---

# 🔥 Q6. Teacher: configurable kya hota hai?

👉 **Student:**
👉 Property delete ya modify kar sakte ho ya nahi

---

## Example

```js
const obj = {};

Object.defineProperty(obj, "name", {
  value: "Vishnu",
  configurable: false
});

delete obj.name; // ❌ delete nahi hoga

console.log(obj.name);
```

👉 Output:

```
Vishnu
```

---

# 📊 Final Summary (Super Simple)

| Property     | Meaning                |
| ------------ | ---------------------- |
| value        | actual value           |
| writable     | change allowed?        |
| enumerable   | loop me dikhega?       |
| configurable | delete/modify allowed? |

---

# 💡 Easy Real-Life Analogy

👉 Socho:

```text
name = Vishnu
```

👉 Rules:

* writable: false → naam change nahi kar sakte
* enumerable: false → hidden hai
* configurable: false → delete nahi kar sakte

---

# 🎯 One Line Samajh

👉 **“defineProperty = property + uske rules control karna”**

---

# 🚀 Real Developer Insight (Important)

👉 Use hota hai:

* secure data
* hidden properties
* read-only values

---

# 🔥 Ultra Simple Code (Yaad rakhne ke liye)

```js
